     3136   on ctrl-f of sch-corr-date in frame Dialog-Frame
     3137   do:
     3138     if (can-query (self, "sensitive")
     3139        and
     3140        self :sensitive = true
     3141        )
     3142     or (can-query (self, "read-only")
     3143        and
